{"speciesId":783,"names":{"fr":"Écaïd","es":"Hakamo-o","en":"Hakamo-o","ja":"ジャランゴ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il se jette sur ses proies en poussant un terrible cri de guerre. Il les déchiquette ensuite avec ses poings écaillés."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se lanza sobre su presa entonando un grito de guerra. Golpea al enemigo y lo hace trizas con sus escamas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It leaps at its prey with a courageous shout. Its scaly punches tear its opponents to shreds."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"雄叫びと ともに 獲物に 飛びかかる。 ウロコの パンチは 相手を ズタズタに 引き裂くぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ses écailles poussent très vite. Chaque nouvelle écaille est plus dure et plus pointue que l’ancienne."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Muda constantemente sus escamas, que cada vez se vuelven más duras y afiladas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It sheds and regrows its scales on a continuous basis. The scales become harder and sharper each time they’re regrown."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"鱗は どんどん 生え変わる。 新しくなるたび 鱗は 硬く 鋭く なっていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fait tinter ses écailles en les frottant les unes contre les autres, et passe à l’attaque quand le rythme atteint son point culminant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Golpea sus escamas entre sí. Cuando culmina el ritmo de esta percusión, se abalanza sobre el enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It makes noise by clanging its scales together. When the rhythm has reached its peak, Hakamo-o attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ウロコを 叩き合わせて 音を 鳴らす。 リズムが 最高潮に 達したところで 襲いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On broie les écailles qu’il a perdues pour fabriquer des casseroles et des poêles à bonne conductivité thermique."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Las escamas que se le caen se utilizan para fabricar pucheros y sartenes muy apreciados, ya que son muy buenas conductoras del calor."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The scales it sheds can be molded and processed to make pots and pans. They conduct heat well, so they’re a popular item."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"はがれた ウロコを 叩いて 鍋や フライパンに 加工。 火の 通りが 良くて 使いやすいと 好評。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses écailles arrachées et son corps couvert de cicatrices sont la preuve de sa puissance. Il les montre à son adversaire vaincu en se pavanant."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Como prueba de su fuerza, muestra orgulloso a quienes vence las cicatrices de su cuerpo donde ya no tiene escamas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The scaleless, scarred parts of its body are signs of its strength. It shows them off to defeated opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ウロコが はがれた 傷だらけの 体は 強者の 証し。 倒した 相手に 見せつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Après avoir fait tinter ses écailles et poussé un terrible cri de guerre, il charge ses ennemis et les lacère de ses griffes acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Tras hacer sonar sus escamas y proferir su grito de guerra, carga contra el enemigo y lo hace trizas con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Before attacking its enemies, it clashes its scales together and roars. Its sharp claws shred the opposition."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ウロコを 打ち鳴らし 雄叫びを あげてから 相手に 挑みかかり 鋭い ツメで ずたずたに する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":783,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"na